    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Dome KmGm\nAFRICA\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "Cocktailo\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini Vermouth\nBloody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch Bourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum Premium Beer\nMenus\nApéritif\nIC Hi 27\nSelected Gourmet Delicacies\nRoast au Vol\nA selected cut of aged beef, lamb or other succulent meat\n* 0-2H E-\nLamb Curry with Chutney\nFillets of Sole Meunière\nChicken Verdi\nTender chicken simmered with capers, olives and celery in a spritely sauce\nRice Pilaf\nPotatoes Maison",
      "Lamb Curry with Chutney\nFillets of Sole Meunière\nChicken Verdi\nTender chicken simmered with capers, olives and celery in a spritely sauce\nRice Pilaf\n{5251z\nPotatoes Maison\n* 5 r\nButtered Vegetable Bouquet\nTossed Garden Salad\n+=5\nSelection of Fruits and Cheeses\nDessert\nFY-r\nCoffee\n3-E-\nTea\nDecaffeinated Coffee\nSelected French Wines\nFrench Champagne Brut\nDrambuie Amaretto di SaronnoK Bénédictine\nCrème de Menthe Cognac VSOP\nContreau\n146 KJ422",
      "AFRICA\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad\nAfrica is a continent of great natural beauty. In addition to abundant wild game it contains a\nmixture of mountains, jungles, magnificent rivers, open plains, and arid deserts.\nMany of its cities are bustling metropolises with broad avenues, modern buildings,\ngood restaurants and fine hotels, including several Inter • Continental Hotels.\nFrom New York, Pan Am 747's serve Dakar, Monrovia, Accra, Lagos, Abidjan, and Nairobi.\nMr. Kingman's painting depicts majestic, snowcapped Mount Kilamanjaro in Tanzania.\nAt 19,340 feet it is Africa's highest mountain\nSPAN AM.\n200/ 080. 267"
